cookbook/decisions/kaggriculture-compiles-gemms-with-cublas-only.md:96:  - Non-GEMM Triton kernels rely on Inductor's own 32-bit-indexing guards.
cookbook/decisions/kaggriculture-compiles-gemms-with-cublas-only.md:99:- **The driver gate is conservative.** The crash mechanism is Inductor codegen, not the driver. A pod with another driver fails at startup until the A/B is repeated there.
