    80	def configure_model_compile(model: nn.Module, cfg: ModelCompileConfig) -> int:
    81	    """Compile the configured model region in place; never the whole model.
    82	
    83	    ``trunk`` dispatches through ``TrunkCompileAPI``, so each model compiles
    84	    only its trunk and keeps its own dispatch (packing, chunking, overflow
    85	    guards) in front of the compiled callable. ``mlp`` compiles the trunk's
    86	    block MLP modules in place. Before any compile, the game claims the
